      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_humanspecies",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Human Species</h3>Think about your grandparents, your great-grandparents, and their great-grandparents. How far back can you trace your family? A few centuries, perhaps. But human history goes much, much further.</p><p>The existence of different human species spans from thousands of years to a few million years. This timeline was built by archaeologists who found ancient bones preserved in rock, such as those of <i>Homo ergaster</i>, a species that lived almost 2 million years ago (<htcite0> ; <htcite1>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "816d0d03-bd90-4bcd-84ef-a2316dc68eff",
                     "text": "Hitchcock, Don",
                     "page": "Homo erectus - Homo ergaster",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2013",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "ab1dda1e-95c2-4087-8299-e851e58bdc6f",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Humans",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"imgHumanSpecies\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgHumanSpecies', '0%')\" class=\"imgcenter\" style=\"width: 20%;\" /><b>Figure 5</b>: Image made by Don Hitchcock and available on Don's Maps (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "816d0d03-bd90-4bcd-84ef-a2316dc68eff",
                     "text": "Hitchcock, Don",
